name: sim.groupShapes
description: Groups (or merges) several shapes into a compound shape (or simple shape)
luaSynopsis: int shapeHandle = sim.groupShapes(list shapeHandles, bool merge = False)
pythonSynopsis: int shapeHandle = sim.groupShapes(int[] shapeHandles, bool merge = false)
inputs:
1. shapeHandles: handles of the shapes to be grouped or merged. The last handle represents the shape that will accept the other shapes
2. merge: whether the shapes should be merged or grouped
outputs:
1. shapeHandle: the handle of the resulting compound shape, which is the last shape in shapeHandles
replacedBy:
- name: groupShapes, class: scene, file: scene_groupShapes.method
- name: mergeShapes, class: scene, file: scene_mergeShapes.method
